<title>GERMANY: Munich air cargo up 16.6pct Jan-Nov 1996.</title>
<headline>Munich air cargo up 16.6pct Jan-Nov 1996.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo handled at Munich airport over the first 11 months of the year increased 16.6 percent to 68,247 tonnes, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>Details of traffic in tonnes with percentage changes from one year ago included:</p>
<p>		    Total traffic	Pct change</p>
<p> November	 68,247		 up 16.6</p>
<p> October	  60,361		 up 14.5</p>
<p> September	53,224		 up 13.0</p>
<p> August	   46,760		 up 12.9</p>
<p>		    Export   Change    Import   Change</p>
<p> November	 33,814   up 10.0   34,433   up 24.0</p>
<p> October	  29,808   up  7.8   30,553   up 21.9</p>
<p> September	26,186   up  5.8   27,038   up 20.8</p>
<p> August	   22,963   up  5.9   23,797   up 20.6</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Muenchen GmbH, traffic statistics dept. - Air Cargo Newroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
